src/server/ — vendored subtree NOTICE
=====================================

This directory is a trimmed, vendored copy of the `server/` tree from
w-okada/voice-changer (https://github.com/w-okada/voice-changer),
licensed under the MIT License. The complete upstream MIT license text,
including every upstream copyright block, is in ./LICENSE next to this
file.

Non-RVC inference engines and the Mac/Windows code paths were removed
(~22k LOC). The file-by-file trimming record is in the repository
CHANGELOG.md under "Phase 1 — Lean Core". No upstream file in this
subtree was modified beyond that removal; any per-file copyright header
present in an upstream file is left intact.

A second trim removed every file that no woys entry point can import
(the web server, REST/socket.io layers, downloaders, the upstream
realtime pipeline and its FAISS index path, the torch/crepe/whisper
extractors and embedders). What remains is the .pth -> .onnx export path
used by `woys convert`: onnxExporter/, inferencer/models.py and
rvc_models/infer_pack/, plus const.py, data/ModelSlot.py,
deviceManager/DeviceManager.py and the VoiceChangerParams helpers they
import.

